  "generated_text": "1. **Simplify the expression inside the sum:**\n   \\[\n   2\\sin{x}\\sin{1}[1 + \\sec (x-1) \\sec (x+1)]\n   \\]\n   Using the identity $\\sec(x) = \\frac{1}{\\cos(x)}$, we have:\n   \\[\n   2\\sin{x}\\sin{1}[1 + \\frac{1}{\\cos(x-1)\\cos(x+1)}]\n   \\]\n   Using the identity $\\cos(x-1)\\cos(x+1) = \\frac{1}{2}[\\cos(2x) + \\cos(2)]$, we get:\n   \\[\n   2\\sin{x}\\sin{1}[1 + \\frac{2}{\\cos(2x) + \\cos(2)}]\n   \\]\n   Simplifying further, we have:\n   \\[\n   2\\sin{x}\\sin{1} + \\frac{4\\sin{x}\\sin{1}}{\\cos(2x) + \\cos(2)}\n   \\]\n\n2. **Evaluate the sum:**\n   We need to evaluate the sum $\\sum_{x=2}^{44}",
